diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0cd6db5..48625d4 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,7 +1,13 @@
-An HTTP server that routes each request by the method and target in its request line.
+An HTTP server that reads the request line, headers, and any Content-Length body before routing the request. Malformed or truncated requests receive 400 Bad Request. Transfer-Encoding is unsupported and receives 400.
+
+`/echo` accepts any method and returns the method and path as plain text, for example `POST /echo`. Query strings are excluded from the echoed path. Existing GET routes `/` and `/users/:userId/posts/:postId` are also supported.
 
 Run: `node server.js`
 
 Minimum Node.js version: 22
 
 Port: 8080
+
+Run tests: `npm test`
+
+Request lines are limited to 8192 bytes (configurable with `MAX_REQUEST_LINE_BYTES`); the request line and headers together are limited to 65536 bytes. The server closes the connection after one response.
